<title>UK: Rugby to sell metals division - paper.</title>
<headline>Rugby to sell metals division - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building materials company Rugby Group Plc is expected to announce soon that its metals subsidiary Ward will be sold to Irish industrial group Kingspan, the Daily Telegraph newspaper said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal is thought to be worth between 20 million to 25 million stg, the Telegraph said.</p>
<p>Last March Rugby announced it would sell its metal building products division in order &quot;to concentrate on core businesses.&quot;</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
